WEBVTT

00:13:29.756 --> 00:13:32.356
(Tiene il tempo)

00:13:32.436 --> 00:13:37.676
(Tiene il tempo)

00:13:37.756 --> 00:13:42.196
(Tiene il tempo)

00:13:42.236 --> 00:13:46.876
(Tiene il tempo)

00:13:46.916 --> 00:13:50.356
